      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/1446-rest-adaptive-op\n\nConflicts resolved by hand:\n- operation/generate.rs, Adaptive2D dispatch: keep the PR's\n  (rest, method) dispatch and rest_adaptive_previous; keep main's\n  StartSide and pocket_started_on for the non-rest Spiral arm (#3355).\n  With rest on, a pass start other than Auto is named as not used\n  (PASS_START_REST_NOTE), the rule that main set for the Pocket (#3354).\n- operation/rest_op_tests.rs: keep both sides' tests; the Adaptive\n  fixture gets main's new pass_start field.\n- tests/rest_adaptive_op.rs: pass_start in the fixtures; new pin\n  a_pass_start_beside_rest_machining_is_named_as_not_used.\n\nRefs #1446\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
